### 3.2 Portfolio Backtest (2020-07-01~2022-12-30, csi300 universe)

- 年化收益 (excess return with cost): 13.98% (如果为 nan 请检查 portfolio_analysis/port_analysis_1day.pkl)
- 信息比 (Information Ratio): 1.26
- 最大回撤: -13.28%
- 成交换手率 (Turnover): 32.90%

